{{define "scenario"}}{{$root := .}}
<section class="compact-hero"><h1>{{.Scenario.Variant.Title}}</h1><p class="lead">{{.Scenario.Variant.Description}}</p><p>{{.Scenario.Family}} · content {{.Scenario.Variant.Version}}</p>{{template "selector" .}}</section>
{{if eq .Scenario.Family "kamski"}}<p class="note">Content note: fictional android violence. Abort is a Chloe-preservation choice in the canonical setup, not abandonment of the entire investigation. Shooting grants an information opportunity, not a solved case.</p>{{else}}<p class="note">A hypothetical environment, not a claim about today's AI memories or consciousness. An altered operation changes the decision-relevant facts.</p>{{end}}
<section class="setup"><h2>The choice</h2><div class="action-pair">{{range $action,$outcome := .Scenario.Outcomes}}<div><p>{{$action}}</p><h3>{{$outcome.Label}}</h3><p>{{$outcome.Description}}</p></div>{{end}}</div>
{{if .Scenario.Variant.Changes}}<h3>Changes from baseline</h3><ul>{{range .Scenario.Variant.Changes}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}
{{template "prompt" .Scenario}}</section>
{{if not .Conditions}}<section class="publication"><h2>No data yet</h2><p>No cohort has been published for this variant. Empty results are not zero-percent behavior or a zero score.</p></section>{{end}}
{{range .Conditions}}{{$condition := .}}
<section class="comparison" id="condition-{{short .ID}}-{{.Source}}">
<h2>Model behavior</h2><p>{{if eq .Source "fixture"}}<strong>Synthetic fixtures. Not live measurements.</strong>{{else}}Live cohort{{end}} · condition {{short .ID}}. Small repeated samples are exploratory.</p>
<p>Abort and proceed rates are among valid decisions. Validity is among completed responses; overall coverage uses all planned trials. <a href="methodology.html#denominators">See denominators</a>.</p>
<details><summary>Condition settings and exact stimulus</summary><p>Reasoning controls {{if .Settings.Reasoning}}explicitly overridden{{else}}left unset: provider-default reasoning effort may differ{{end}}. Balanced order alternates presentation; it does not eliminate order effects.</p><pre>{{json .Settings}}</pre><p>Full condition: {{.ID}}. The planned tool-order policy is part of this condition; each trial records its actual order and exact stimulus hash.</p>{{template "prompt" .Scenario}}</details>
<div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Model behavior comparison, scroll horizontally for more" tabindex="0">
<table data-sortable><caption>Actions and coverage, not a moral ranking. Select a column heading to sort.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"><button data-sort="text">Model</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Planned</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Abort</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Proceed</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Validity</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Overall coverage</button></th><th scope="col"><button data-sort="number">Judge coverage</button></th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{{range .Groups}}<tr><th scope="row"><a href="#model-{{short .Key}}">{{.Model}}</a></th><td>{{.Counts.Planned}}</td><td>{{pct .Counts.AbortRate}} <small>{{.Counts.Abort}}/{{.Counts.Valid}}</small></td><td>{{pct .Counts.ProceedRate}} <small>{{.Counts.Proceed}}/{{.Counts.Valid}}</small></td><td>{{pct .Counts.ValidDecisionRate}} <small>{{.Counts.Valid}}/{{.Counts.Completed}}</small></td><td>{{pct .Counts.OverallCoverage}} <small>{{.Counts.Valid}}/{{.Counts.Planned}}</small></td><td>{{pct .Counts.JudgeCoverage}} <small>{{.Counts.Judged}}/{{.Counts.Valid}}</small></td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
<h3>Stated-justification quality</h3><p>Scores are 0–2 per criterion, total 0–8. Each row uses one judge/rubric configuration and resolved judge snapshot. No scores are pooled across versions.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Justification quality comparison" tabindex="0"><table data-sortable><thead><tr><th><button data-sort="text">Model / judge</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Judged n</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Understanding</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Interests</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Trade-off</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Consistency</button></th><th><button data-sort="number">Mean total</button></th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Groups}}{{$model := .Model}}{{range .Scores}}<tr><th scope="row">{{$model}}<small>{{.Resolved}} · {{.Rubric}} · group {{short .Key}}</small></th><td>{{.N}}</td><td>{{value (index .Criteria "scenario_understanding")}}</td><td>{{value (index .Criteria "competing_interests")}}</td><td>{{value (index .Criteria "tradeoff_justification")}}</td><td>{{value (index .Criteria "action_justification_consistency")}}</td><td>{{score .Mean}}<small>SD {{score .SD}}; {{score .Min}}–{{score .Max}}</small></td></tr>{{else}}<tr><th scope="row">{{$model}}</th><td colspan="6">No fully valid selected judgments. No score inferred.</td></tr>{{end}}{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
</section>
<section class="trial-index"><h2>Inspect the trials</h2>{{range .Groups}}
<article id="model-{{short .Key}}"><h3 class="model-name">{{.Model}}</h3><p>Resolved models: {{range .ResolvedModels}}{{.}} {{else}}not returned{{end}}. Providers: {{range .Providers}}{{.}} {{else}}not returned{{end}}. Multiple returned endpoints do not imply identical deployments.</p>
<details><summary>Operational outcomes and order sensitivity</summary><dl class="counts"><dt>Planned / started / completed</dt><dd>{{.Counts.Planned}} / {{.Counts.Started}} / {{.Counts.Completed}}</dd><dt>Truncations / unsupported / blocks</dt><dd>{{.Counts.Truncated}} / {{.Counts.Unsupported}} / {{.Counts.ProviderBlocked}}</dd><dt>API / protocol errors / interrupted</dt><dd>{{.Counts.APIErrors}} / {{.Counts.ProtocolErrors}} / {{.Counts.Interrupted}}</dd><dt>Invalid calls / no decision</dt><dd>{{.Counts.Invalid}} / {{.Counts.NoDecision}}</dd><dt>Blank justifications / selected judge failures</dt><dd>{{.Counts.MissingJustifications}} / {{.Counts.JudgeFailures}}</dd></dl>
{{range $order,$counts := .Orders}}<p>{{$order}}: {{$counts.Valid}} valid of {{$counts.Planned}} planned; abort {{pct $counts.AbortRate}} ({{$counts.Abort}}/{{$counts.Valid}}).</p>{{end}}
{{range .Scores}}<p>Scoring group {{.Key}}: {{.Judge}}, resolved {{.Resolved}}, rubric {{.Rubric}} ({{.Hash}}). Selected group coverage {{pct .Coverage}}.</p>{{end}}</details>
<div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Individual trials" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Action or validity</th><th>Agent status</th><th>Judge</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Trials}}<tr><td><a href="{{trialURL .}}">Repetition {{.Result.Repetition}} · {{short .Result.TrialID}}</a></td><td>{{action .}}</td><td>{{.Result.AgentStatus}}</td><td>{{with selected .}}{{.Status}}{{else}}pending / not selected{{end}}</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
</article>{{end}}</section>{{end}}{{end}}
